              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Natavu na Aviu, ana ma Aluni, kĩla ũmwe osa kĩtoeesya kyake, na eekĩa mwaki nthĩnĩ wakyo, na eekĩa ũvani ĩũlũ waw’o, na mamũthembea Yeova na mwaki ũte wa vo, ũla ũtaameaĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
