              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mose ameta Misaeli na Elisavani, ana ma Usieli mwendw’a ĩthe wa Aluni, na amea, Thengeeai, mũkue ana‐a‐ĩthe menyu kũmaumya mbee wa vala vandũ vatheu mũmatwae ũtee wa mwako wa maeema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
